# Framework fabrication workspace

This repository declares `repository_kind: framework_source` in
`.fabric/project-profile.yaml`. Full workflow: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).

There is **no** root `.ai-team/` here — that layout exists only on installed
client projects. Read [`.cursor/rules/05-workspace-layout.mdc`](05-workspace-layout.mdc)
for the full layout and forbidden client-cycle actions.

## Edit here

- Implementation: `src/governed_ai/`, `adapters/`, `distribution/`
- Installable payload: `distribution/payload/.ai-team/` (constitution, schemas, contracts, templates)
- Client Cursor payload: `adapters/cursor/templates/.cursor/` (root `.cursor/` is fabrication-only)
- Framework product intent: `docs/product/`

## After installable payload changes

```bash
python scripts/ai-team/sync_source_manifest.py
python scripts/ai-team/validate.py
```

## Installed-client reference

`tests/fixtures/projects/clean/` or `python tools/install.py --target <dir>`.

## Communication language

Read `.fabric/project-profile.yaml` → `communication.language`. Reply to the
human in that language. Never translate YAML keys, enum values, file paths,
commands, or code.
